 dangerous place where emotions, will and desire hold power.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Discover the Truth:</strong> Keep your sanity and wits about you whilst uncovering a dark story of love, loss and deception, where nothing is as it seems and every turn brings another twist to unravel.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Next Generation Visuals:</strong> Explore a meticulously detailed world with stunning visuals and effects all powered by Unreal Engine 5.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>An Unforgettable Soundtrack:</strong> A specially created soundtrack that combines orchestral scores with original songs that draw you into the cinematic world of Karma, created in collaboration with Dolby Atmos.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Missions? What Missions?","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1376200/afff30e7358f7bcee284fce59dc7fc1e74317965.jpg"},{"name":"Nightcrawler","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1376200/bb6d065dd73db110efb06b391b2802d7c716822a.jpg"},{"name":"I Will Echo","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1376200/5d22ec971b34b749c206332718f66e3c8a16243c.jpg"},{"name":"D\u00e9j\u00e0 vu","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1376200/1b45adc5b5fa114a69decd65fad25584b47dce82.jpg"},{"name":"BlueBottles! More BlueBottles!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1376200/9ee2acc994fa6271d5a3c8e7db44f992012a573a.jpg"},{"name":"Why's It Always Me?","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1376200/b269ab2641d9948f3d1ad0942c46265061d24162.jpg"},{"name":"We Made a Deal","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1376200/7e4ab2df3619d62cb4c4770b5debacda72bccda6.jpg"},{"name":"Naughty Boy","path":"https://cdn.akam