4ede5fc6de.webm?t=1769796279\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1376200/extras/36179fc9f39bca9b2aa1664ede5fc6de.mp4?t=1769796279\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1376200/extras/e5bcad336870f02dfe1941c4dfb4662f.webp?t=1769796279\" width=600 height=36 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Karma: The Dark World utilises the most advanced Unreal Engine 5 features, including Lumen and Nanite, that push the visual boundaries of storytelling \u2013 combining meticulously detailed visuals of a dystopian reality, high quality motion-capped acting and mind bending surreal environments to create a distinctly immersive experience. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1376200/extras/d941aa0563521690dc6c968c633948dc.webp?t=1769796279\" width=600 height=30 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Features:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Become a Roam Agent: </strong>Step into the shoes of Daniel McGovern and use a combination of investigative tools, interviews and your own keen intellect to solve puzzles and unravel the truth.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Open Your Mind: </strong>Dive into the memories of suspects to retrace their steps and piece together your investigations, but be careful - the human mind is a dangerous place where emotions, will and desire hold power.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Discover the Truth:</strong> Keep your sanity and wits about you whilst uncovering a dark story of love, loss and deception, where nothing is as it seems and every turn brings another twist to unravel.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Next Generation Visuals:</strong> Explore a meticulously detailed world with stunning visuals and effects all powered by Unreal Engine 5.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>An Unforgettable Soundtrack:</strong> A specially created soundtrack that combines orchestral scores with original songs that draw you into the cinematic world of Karma, created in collaboration with Dolby Atmos.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","developers":["POLLARD STUDIO LLC"],"dlc":[3439750,3439760,3535810],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1376200/b85b35c8a7b5e745d38584bae8ae704f41cc4493/header.jpg?t=1769796279","is_free":false,"legal_notice":"KARMA: The Dark World \u00a9 2025 Pollard Studio. Developed by Pollard Studio. Published by Wired Productions Ltd and Gamera Games. KARMA: The Dark World and the KARMA: The Dark World logo are trademarks of Pollard Studio. All rights reserved.","linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/1376200/459892057/e19e17a03fd655dce1cac170ec3a367814d6f309/1750951799/dash_av1.mpd?t=1750953787","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/1376200/459892057/e19e17a03fd655dce1cac170ec3a367814d6f309/1750951799/dash_h264.mpd?t=1750953787","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/1376200/459892057/e19e17a03fd655dce1cac170ec3a367814d6f309/1750951799/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1750953787","id":257161937,"name":"Photomode Trailer","thumbna